572	     * Maps {@code owner} to its DTO and sets the {@code bulkSignupWarning} flag: {@code true} when
573	     * more than {@link #BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD} owners have already been created for this
574	     * owner's registration date, otherwise {@code false}.
