753	     * Validates an owner's optional {@code registrationDate}. When absent nothing is checked (the
754	     * date defaults to the server date). When present it must not be later than the current server
755	     * date: a registration cannot be recorded in the future, so a future date is rejected with a 400.
756	     *
757	     * @param registrationDate the supplied registration date (may be {@code null} when not supplied)
758	     * @throws InvalidFieldValueException if the supplied date is later than the server date
759	     */
