798	     * lowerEmail + '|' + soundex(lastName)}) is the single consolidated duplicate-detection key that
799	     * replaces the former separate telephone, email and household checks. Because the telephone is
800	     * part of the key, two owners with the same last name and postcode but different telephones have
801	     * different keys and are both allowed (they surface as a soft match instead); only an exact
802	     * full-key match is a duplicate. Soft-deleted owners are ignored, and the email-domain blocklist
